+	/*
+	 * The framebuffer is not cleared between boots, so any mark left by a
+	 * previous boot would bleed into this boot's photograph: the corners
+	 * would show its last counter and the sub-ladder row its final marks.
+	 * Wipe both here, before this boot paints anything.
