+	 * TTBR0 switch the V=P bootstrap map still covers it. After the switch
+	 * only the kernel tables do, and sagit_map_fb() has put an alias for it
+	 * in the tail of the physmap padding by then. Without that alias the
+	 * physmap (exactly the 256 MB window the loader handed over, while
+	 * SimpleFb lives at 0x9d400000) cannot see the framebuffer at all and
+	 * every checkpoint until initialize_screen() goes blind.
+	 */
