+		 * The blind window. ml_io_map_unmappable() needs pmap_bootstrap()
+		 * and the kernel map, neither of which exists yet, and calling it
+		 * here is a silent crash -- the reset this ladder kept hitting at
+		 * the TTBR0 switch. Record the step instead and let the first
+		 * checkpoint that can see the framebuffer paint the whole gap.
+		 */
+		sagit_bar_next = index + 1;
+		return;
+	}
